\f0\fs40 \cf2 Pencil push-ups are used to improve convergence, which is the ability of the eyes to turn inward together when looking at something up close. This exercise is often recommended for people with convergence insufficiency or related near focusing symptoms.\
\

\f1\b How to do the exercise:
\f0\b0 \
\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li680\fi-360\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 1. Hold one pencil at arm\'92s length directly in front of you, lined up with the middle of your face.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li740\fi-420\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 2. Focus on a small letter or symbol on the pencil and keep it single and clear.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li760\fi-440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 3. Slowly move the pencil toward your nose while trying to keep the target single.\
4. Stop when the target becomes double and cannot be made single again, or when it becomes very blurry.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li740\fi-420\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 5. Move the pencil slightly farther away until it becomes single again.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li760\fi-440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 6. Repeat 10-15 times, once or twice a day. \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
Suppression control:\
\
To make sure both eyes are working, use a second pencil in the background, placed farther away and lined up behind the closer pencil. While you look at the closer pencil, the farther pencil should appear double. This is normal and confirms that both eyes are contributing. If the farther pencil does not appear double, one eye may be suppressing. If that happens, let the clinic know.\
\
Important points:\
\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li680\fi-360\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 1. Mild eye strain is common, but the exercise should not be painful.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li740\fi-420\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 2. Try to keep the closer pencil single for as long as possible.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li760\fi-440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf2 3. Good posture and steady attention help.\
4. Do the exercise as prescribed, since consistency matters more than force or speed.}